Hi Aref,

Your counting percentage does not seem to be low to me since the gene annotation for rat is as good as those for mouse and human genomes. Also the '-P' and '-Q 10' options further excluded some reads from counting.

You used '-s 1' option. So your data are strand specific data?

You do not need to provide '-G' option since it is only useful for counting reads for junctions. It only works when you provided '-J' option as well.

Best regards,

Wei

